WEBVTT

00:01:28.831 --> 00:01:31.827
Shairi inaonekana isiyo ya kawaida

00:01:31.827 --> 00:01:35.356
kuandikwa na msichana wa miaka 13,

00:01:35.356 --> 00:01:40.139
lakini tunapotoka mimi na Eileen,

00:01:40.139 --> 00:01:43.900
shairi hiyo, niliyoikusomeeni,

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.616
ni sauti ya shujaa.

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:50.541
Ninatoka Malawi.

00:01:51.191 --> 00:01:55.115
Malawi ni nchi ya maskini,

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.994
maskini sana,

00:01:57.994 --> 00:02:02.522
ambapo usawa wa kijinsi sio hakika.